      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Yasuo's Critical Strike Chance is increased. Additionally, Yasuo builds toward a shield whenever he is moving. The shield triggers when he takes damage from a champion or monster.",
      "summary_zh": "亚索的暴击几率提升。此外，亚索在移动时会为一层护盾攒能。护盾会在他受到来自英雄或野怪的伤害时触发。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307207:4051866"
